    "identifier": "grimnir-true-believer-wrath-of-divinity",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you deal Sneak Attack damage to a creature, you can deal an additional 3d6 Radiant or Necrotic Damage (your choice).</p><ul><li>If you choose Radiant, one creature you can see within 60 feet regains Hit Points equal to the bonus damage dealt.</li><li>If you choose Necrotic, the target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw against your spell save DC or have the Frightened condition until the end of your next turn. You can use this feature a number of times equal to your Dexterity Modifier, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</li></ul><ul><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.grimnir.Item.ee2319d46c2aa8a1]{Wrath of Divinity — Radiant}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.grimnir.Item.846d4bbf4bab953d]{Wrath of Divinity — Necrotic}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.grimnir.Item.5c1703bb7313e13f]{Necrotic: save}</li></ul>"
    },
